.TH SIMRV-TUNE 1 "November 2026" "SimRV 3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
simrv-tune \- alias for the SimRV target-evaluation tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B simrv-tune
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ target ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B simrv-tune
is an alias for \fBsimrv-parity\fR. Use \fB--tune\fR to tune CPU or platform
configuration parameters against a registered hardware-model target.
.SH OPTIONS
The command accepts the same options as \fBsimrv-parity\fR, including
\fB--plugin\fR, \fB--target-dir\fR, \fB--config\fR, \fB--trace-dir\fR,
\fB--out\fR, \fB--tune\fR, \fB--quick\fR, and \fB--apply\fR. See
\fBsimrv-parity --help\fR for the complete option list.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR simrv (1),
.BR simrv-parity (1)
